o comedy-drama starring Will Smith as a drunken, foul-mouthed hero with a unique set of powers.\\n5. **Kick-Ass (2010)** - a darkly comedic, action-packed film based on the comic book series, following a teenager who becomes a superhero.\\n\\n**Upcoming Non-Marvel Superhero Movies:**\\n\\n1. **The Flash (2023)** - a DC Extended Universe film starring Ezra Miller as the Fastest Man Alive.\\n2. **Blue Beetle (2023)** - a DC Comics adaptation about a teenager who becomes a superhero after discovering a powerful scarab.\\n3. **The Boys (TV Series, 2020)** - a dark, subversive take on the superhero genre, based on the comic book series by Garth Ennis and Darick Robertson.\\n\\nI hope you find something that piques your interest! '}, {'role': 'user', 'content': \"I've already seen The Dark Knight, it's one of my favorite movies. I'm more interested in newer releases. Can you recommend some recent non-Marvel superhero movies from the past few years? \"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In that case, here are some recent non-Marvel superhero movies from the past few years that you might enjoy:\\n\\n**DC Extended Universe (DCEU) Movies:**\\n\\n1. **Wonder Woman 1984 (2020)** - The sequel to the 2017 film, set in the 1980s and starring Gal Gadot as Wonder Woman.\\n2. **Birds of Prey (and the Fantabulous Emancipation of One Harley Quinn) (2020)** - A spin-off film featuring Margot Robbie as Harley Quinn, following her after the events of Suicide Squad.\\n3. **Shazam! (2019)** - A lighthearted, family-friendly film about a teenage boy who becomes a powerful superhero.\\n\\n**Other Superhero Movies:**\\n\\n1. **Bloodshot (2020)** - A sci-fi action film based on the Valiant Comics character, starring Vin Diesel as a soldier brought back to life with superhuman abilities.\\n2. **Sonic the Hedgehog (2020)** - A live-action/CGI film based on the popular video game character, starring Ben Schwartz as the voice of Sonic.\\n3. **The Old Guard (2020)** - A Netflix original film based on the comic book series, following a group of immortal mercenaries led by Charlize Theron.\\n\\n**Upcoming Non-Marvel Superhero Movies:**\\n\\n1. **The Flash (2023)** - A DC Extended Universe film starring Ezra Miller as the Fastest Man Alive.\\n2. **Blue Beetle (2023)** - A DC Comics adaptation about a teenager who becomes a superhero after discovering a powerful scarab.\\n3. **Black Adam (2022)** - A DC Extended Universe film starring Dwayne \"The Rock\" Johnson as the titular anti-hero.\\n\\nKeep in mind that release dates may vary depending on your region and the current pandemic situation. I hope you find something that interests you! '}, {'role': 'user', 'content': \"I've heard good things about Shazam!, can you tell me more about it? Is it a light-hearted superhero film like Spider-Man: No Way Home? \"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Shazam! is indeed a light-hearted superhero film, and it shares a similar tone with Spider-Man: No Way Home. Here\\'s what you can expect:\\n\\n**Story:** Shazam! follows the story of Billy Batson (Asher Angel), a 14-year-old foster kid who is chosen by an ancient wizard (Djimon Hounsou) to be the new champion of the gods. When Billy says the magic word \"Shazam! \", he transforms into a powerful adult superhero (Zachary Levi) with incredible abilities.\\n\\n**Tone:** The film has a playful, humorous tone, with a focus on Billy\\'s fish-out-of-water experience as a teenager trapped in a grown-up body with superpowers. It\\'s a coming-of-age story with plenty of humor, heart, and action. The movie doesn\\'t take itself too seriously, and it\\'s full of Easter eggs and references to classic superhero movies and TV shows.\\n\\n**Comparison to Spider-Man: No Way Home:** Both films share a similar tone and themes, such as:\\n\\n* A young protagonist learning to navigate their newfound powers and responsibilities\\n* A light-hearted, humorous approach to the superhero genre\\n* A focus on character development and relationships\\n* Plenty of action and excitement, but not overly dark or gritty\\n\\nHowever, Shazam! has a more innocent and naive tone, which fits with the character\\'s origin story and the film\\'s nostalgic vibe. Spider-Man: No Way Home, on the other hand, deals with more mature themes and has a larger scope, given its connection to the Marvel Cinematic Universe.\\n\\n**What to expect:**\\n\\n* A fun, family-friendly film with plenty of humor and heart\\n* Impressive visual effects and action sequences\\n* Strong performances from the cast, especially Zachary Levi and Asher Angel\\n* A nostalgic feel, with nods to classic superhero movies and TV shows\\n* A story that explores themes of family, identity, and the power of kindness\\n\\nOverall, Shazam! is a great choice if you\\'re looking for a light-hearted superhero film with a strong focus on character development and humor. '}, {'role': 'user', 'content': \"I'm curious about the cast, especially Zachary Levi. Has he played any other notable roles before Shazam!?\n <Assistant> I have memorized the conversation and I will answer the question you ask."